AnnotationAssertion(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020124> "true"^^xsd:boolean)

# Individual: <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020125> (aggregate state suprasolid)

